      "created_at": "2016-01-27T14:46:31.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This may be spoilers for those who haven't gotten VotM or seen the cards.</p><p>V<br>V<br>V<br>V<br>V<br>V</p><p><span>Why is Ambuscade's face not horribly scarred, unless he's so vain he thinks that little scratch is \"horribly disfigured\"?</span></p><p><span>Is there somewhere that explains this?</span></p>",
