      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>This may be spoilers for those who haven&#39;t gotten VotM or seen the cards.</p><p>V<br />V<br />V<br />V<br />V<br />V</p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Why is Ambuscade&#39;s face not horribly scarred, unless he&#39;s so vain he thinks that little scratch is &quot;horribly disfigured&quot;?</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Is there somewhere that explains this?</span></p>",
